    {
      "strategyName": "Mega Raichu Y Recycle",
      "weather": "Extreme",
      "adventureEffect": "None",
      "difficulty": "4★",
      "text": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>Mega Skarmory is a decently bulky raid boss that has access to some fairly hard hitting fast and charged attacks. </p><p><br></p><h4>Est Time to Win </h4><h4>270s - 290s</h4><p><br></p><h2>Main Strategy</h2><p>The strategy to this raid is to recycle Mega Raichu Y with its powerful move zap cannon+. Mega Raichu Y is quite a glassy Pokemon so both of skarmory's fast moves deal considerable damage to it, dodging flash cannon is useful to reduce the number or rejoins. Before using zap cannon+ be sure that mega skarmory is not about to use a flash cannon as flash cannon is a faster move than zap cannon+ so it may results in Mega Raichu Y getting hit mid charged attack and losing a lot of health or even faint which results in time loss.</p><p><br></p><h2>Video Credits</h2><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/tWYgRE4-IfY?si=kW-yzCNlegpm7zQ_\" target=\"_blank\">Solo Mega Skarmory 280s NWB/NAE Mega Raichu Y Recycle</a></p>",
